# Project Foundation Implementation Plan

Establish the initial foundational structure and runtime baseline for a full-stack AWS Route 53 clone, featuring a Next.js (TypeScript) frontend and a FastAPI (Python + SQLite) backend.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> In accordance with project requirements and instructions, this foundation phase will NOT implement Hosted Zones, DNS Records, authentication, AWS integrations, mock data, or feature UIs. It focuses strictly on application shell, directory structure, configurations, and connectivity.

- **Frontend Styling**: Standard Next.js with vanilla CSS tokens (no TailwindCSS as per guidelines) tailored to a clean AWS Console aesthetic.
- **Backend Architecture**: Layered FastAPI structure (`core`, `api`, `models`, `schemas`, `services`) with SQLAlchemy SQLite session management and a `GET /health` endpoint.

